Extra audio formats in the built-in player use Media3's FFmpeg decoder
(androidx/media decoder_ffmpeg 1.8.0, Apache License 2.0, unmodified), which
links FFmpeg dynamically. On 64-bit devices that is the FFmpeg 8.1.3 of
ffmpeg-kit-https (GNU Lesser General Public License 3.0). On 32-bit ARM the
app ships FFmpeg 8.1.3, unmodified, built with only audio decoders and
without GPL or non-free parts (GNU Lesser General Public License 2.1 or
